      "playingOnly": "mediaPlayerPlayingOnly, left out of the JSON when off.",
      "deviceClass": "A chip removes its value when listed, else appends it (tap order); an empty list removes deviceClassFilter.",
      "maxValue": "Trimmed text: empty removes maxNumericValue; a finite number is written; anything else is refused and the stored value stays. The box shows a whole number without a fraction.",
